WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.601
In one minute, you will put SoCal Lights on your phone, and see what works with no signal.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:10.732
On your phone, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.937 --> 00:00:13.242
This is the home page.

00:00:13.242 --> 00:00:15.908
There is nothing to download from an app store.

00:00:16.809 --> 00:00:18.617
On an iPhone, use Safari.

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:22.928
Tap the Share button, scroll down, and tap Add to Home Screen.

00:00:24.335 --> 00:00:26.530
On an Android phone, use Chrome.

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:29.258
Tap the three dots, then tap Install app.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:33.018
With no signal, the app still opens.

00:00:33.018 --> 00:00:36.073
Your last list of places is saved on your phone.

00:00:36.974 --> 00:00:40.387
When your signal comes back, the app updates by itself.

00:00:41.389 --> 00:00:43.792
Next up: Find contests.
